  "notes": [
    "Only v48-fourth-flow, v48-stable-native, v48-accepted-screenshots, v48-landing-native-scene, v48-final-site-landing and v48-delivery-site-accessibility are authoritative. Earlier partial PNGs/reports are retained.",
    "The first two flow attempts raced live notes:open consumption with reload. The durable-nav check now detaches its consumer on a same-origin blank document before queueing. about:blank was unsuitable because the mock uses origin-scoped localStorage.",
    "Native scene setup corrected lazy WebView creation, string-only NoteDraft items, IPC readiness and actual DPR2 dimensions; the fourth scene was 1x despite initial metadata and is superseded. Settled animations/focus before direct CDP capture; full transparent island host avoids cropping its CSS shadow.",
    "Native smoke waits for both saved body and cleared checkpoint; separate persistence/ack steps can briefly expose one before the other. Each owned restart gets a fresh CDP port to avoid a retiring WebView2 listener. No production assertion was removed.",
    "First sticky screenshot run overlapped the final Vite build, causing missing asset requests. The accepted run began after completed build.",
    "Legacy capture-site driver assumes the mobile nav CTA is always visible; current Figma navigation puts it in an accessible menu. Current accessibility suite tests that menu and all CTAs; dedicated Notes driver verifies new desktop/mobile composition. Legacy failure retained, not a task gate.",
    "Dedicated Notes capture eagerly decodes hidden lazy variants. Desktop halves are captured separately to meet 300000-byte PNG budget; mobile display:contents copy is captured in its full section. No downsampling/recomposition.",
    "OG provenance was regenerated after changing shared site CSS. Optional PHP suite skipped: installed PHP lacks pdo_sqlite."
  ]
}
